rent status, which indicates the project is meeting its goals and timeline."},statusAtRisk:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.atlassian-project-status-update-action-renderer.card-header.status-at-risk.non-final",defaultMessage:"At risk",description:"Status label text displayed in the Atlassian project status update action card header within the AI conversation interface, indicating that the project may encounter issues but is not yet off track. Shown as a status badge or label in the card header. The purpose is to clearly communicate the project's current status, which indicates the project has potential risks that need attention."},statusOffTrack:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.atlassian-project-status-update-action-renderer.card-header.status-off-track.non-final",defaultMessage:"Off track",description:"Status label text displayed in the Atlassian project status update action card header within the AI conversation interface, indicating that the project is not meeting its goals or timeline. Shown as a status badge or label in the card header. The purpose is to clearly communicate the project's current status, which indicates the project needs immediate attention to get back on track."},phasePaused:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.atlassian-project-status-update-action-renderer.card-header.phase-paused.non-final",defaultMessage:"Paused",description:"Phase label text displayed in the Atlassian project status update action card header within the AI conversation interface, indicating that the project phase is currently paused. Shown as a phase badge or label in the card header. The purpose is to clearly communicate the project phase status, which indicates work on this phase has been temporarily halted."},phasePending:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.atlassian-project-status-update-action-renderer.card-header.phase-pending.non-final",defaultMessage:"Pending",description:"Phase label text displayed in the Atlassian project statu